Not suitable for people with disabilities.\n2. Since it also includes sound-based puzzles, it is not recommended to mute the audio.\n\n**FULL VERSION:** https://vr.meta.me/s/20kcVnSpMXSS6IY\n\n{941003565472736}\n**Strange sounds echo around you, eerie reflections distort reality, and an unsettling atmosphere surrounds everything. Experience it in full.**\n{791086930495623}\n**Sometimes simple, sometimes hiding in plain sight\u2014so obvious you\u2019ll wonder how you missed it\u2014and sometimes demanding intense focus and thought, the puzzles will test you at every turn.**\n{2774330709585701}\n**In a tense, unsettling environment, you must control your emotions while solving the puzzles. Any rushed or thoughtless move will turn the rooms into places you can never escape.**", "short_description": "Escape the rooms by solving puzzles and staying calm!\nTry to escape from rooms filled with unique puzzles and mechanics.\nThrills against time and an atmosphere blended with horror elements await you!"}]}, "developer_name": "None Play Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "None Play Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "38574143385564731"}, "review_messages"